{"id": "EUVD-2026-83475", "enisaUuid": "931c8823-8935-3104-91f6-1e3e48164ddd", "description": "The Better Messages \u2013 Chat Rooms, Group Chat, Private Messages & AI Chat Bots plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to authorization bypass in all versions up to, and including, 2.15.33. This is due to the plugin not properly verifying that a user is authorized to perform an action. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with custom-level access and above, to access the full message transcript, thread metadata, and user data of any chat-room thread without authentication. This is only exploitable when the chat room's only_joined_can_read setting retains its default value of '0'.", "datePublished": "2026-09-19T02:27:10", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-19T14:01:26", "baseScore": 6.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/b3243fe4-9d11-49f0-884b-0162cd776993?source=cve", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/rest-api.php#L2598", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/rest-api.php#L181", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/rest-api.php#L418", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/functions.php#L3533", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/functions.php#L3582", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/functions.php#L3601", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/bp-better-messages/tags/2.15.33/inc/rest-api.php#L1964", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?old_path=bp-better-messages%2Ftags%2F2.15.33%2Finc%2Ffunctions.php&new_path=bp-better-messages%2Ftags%2F3.0.0%2Finc%2Ffunctions.php"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4f44-p79q-6vj4", "CVE-2026-89334"], "assigner": "Wordfence", "epss": 0.7, "enisaI